{"quest":"Gertrude's Cat","character":"Gertrude","text":"My beloved feline friend Fluffs. She's been purring by my side for almost a decade. Please, could you go search for her while I look over the kids?","uri":"dcf9313429c402c66e7496a366b7ce0b.mp3"}
{"quest":"Gertrude's Cat","character":"Gertrude","text":"Oh by the way, the kitten can live in your backpack, but to make it grow you must take it out and feed and stroke it often.","uri":"3bbd0b06ed3a5c711127eed834c513d3.mp3"}
{"quest":"Gertrude's Cat","character":"Gertrude","text":"Oh dear, oh dear! Maybe she's just hungry. She loves doogle sardines but I'm all out.","uri":"a1cf74154537571a3a3e529567bb1cac.mp3"}
